The simulation files are generated by running the following commands from ssh on the Google Cloud VM:

# log link function
sudo -u rstudio bash /home/rstudio/teh_detection/experiments/run_simulations.sh log

# identity link function
sudo -u rstudio bash /home/rstudio/teh_detection/experiments/run_simulations.sh log

to kill all the running threads creating files run:

sudo -u rstudio bash /home/rstudio/teh_detection/experiments/kill_simulations.sh
